# FEAUTURES

One-page React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind showcase of design ideas,
layouts, effects, open-source libraries and free template libraries.
Read `AGENTS.md` and `DESIGN.md` before changing anything.

- Commands: `npm install`, `npm run dev`, `npm run build` (must pass),
  `npm run test`, `npm run preview`.
- Never copy designs, code, images or branding from any source or template
  library. Summarise in original wording, link out, check each licence.
- Motion+ is paid and off limits. Free MIT Motion library only; never call
  an effect "Motion+".
- All motion respects `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`. Ticker and carousel
  pause on hover/focus. Cursor ring never replaces the native cursor.
- Data in `src/opensource.tsx` / `src/templates.tsx`; components in
  `src/effects.tsx` / `src/demos.tsx`; page in `src/App.tsx`. Heavy demos
  stay lazily loaded. Tokens exactly as in `DESIGN.md`.
- Verify a library on GitHub (licence, stars, last push, check date) before
  adding it. Install only what the page uses.
- Update Sources, Honesty note and `README.md` in the same change when a
  claim or structure changes.
